    "name": "disney-plant-trainer-plugin",
    "description": "Comprehensive Disney-style landscape plant training system. Scrapes royalty-free plant images from botanical websites, Unsplash, Pexels, and Pixabay. Downloads high-resolution photos of flowers, shrubs, trees, hedges, and ground cover. Analyzes spatial relationships between plants including spacing, height ratios, layering depth, color transitions, and focal point placement. Learns Disney landscape principles: forced perspective, hidden Mickeys, themed color palettes, seasonal rotations, and immersive garden design. Trains ML models for plant classification, arrangement scoring, height optimization, and aesthetic evaluation. Generates datasets annotated with plant positions, species identification, and spacing measurements. Perfect for landscape architects, theme park designers, horticulturists, garden planners, and anyone studying professional Disney-quality plant arrangements and botanical garden design patterns.",
